    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A scientific and technical illustrator Embraced in 1997 after two separate unnerving encounters with @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} vampires — one of whom spared her out of admiration for her art — left her disillusioned with science and drawn to surrealist and horrific subject matter. The Black Eagles recruited her for her artistic talent.</p><p>See Richard B. Weinstein's entry for the pack's shared background as Black Eagle Consulting, Inc.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Katherine is the newest and most conventionally human-seeming of the pack, still processing her transformation through her art. She is observant and curious rather than jaded.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed):</strong> Dominate 2, Obtenebration 1, Potence 1.</p>",
    "notes": "Convert Disciplines to owned power Items: Dominate 2, Obtenebration 1, Potence 1.",
